;   "storesAssets": true, "assetLifetime": 3600, "fetchesAssets": true,
;   "acceptedRooms": true, "minIntervalSeconds": 30, "maxIdleSeconds": 120}
; Version 2's hello: the keepalive pair the provider answers as a
